  str_files_story_title_35042 = "The Meaning of Work",
  str_files_story_title_30133 = "Epilogue: The Wonderland.",
  str_files_story_des_10101 = "To be added",
  str_files_story_des_10201 = "Everyone is tired and worn out by the successive battles. Perhaps the biggest enemy is fatigue and not Eclipsites...",
  str_files_story_des_10202 = "Because of Angel's request, you've discovered the real purpose of another room on the Colossus, as well as another side of Angel...",
  str_files_story_des_10203 = "Poor Dove can't seem to take it easy. Can you help her? She's lazy, but at least she's still working... That's in her own words.",
  str_files_story_des_10204 = "As Zoya is too good with words, you had no choice but to agree to her request. Although Zoya didn't intend for things to go this far, she still got what she wanted...",
  str_files_story_des_10301 = "When Soroz was sent to Undercity 28, Charon told you some things about Undercity 28 and the Illumina Federation. This is your opportunity to learn more about this world.",
  str_files_story_des_10302 = "When you and Hiiro were hanging around on the Soroz after the incident involving Mendelson, she opened up to you about some things she usually wouldn't talk about—perhaps it was because she was curious about the Caelestites.",
  str_files_story_des_10303 = "It's rare for Vice to have free time, but she's actually using her free time to measure the various parameters of the Colossus. Could she be thinking about doing something to the Colossus? It couldn't be...",
  str_files_story_des_10304 = "Carleen and Vice were chatting about their days in Lumopolis and had a \"friendly\" debate about the rule and governance of Lumopolis...",
  str_files_story_des_10305 = "In a short period of time, the daily routines in Gannon City fell into chaos, leaving everyone at a loss. Vivian rushed there to resolve the issue. Because of this, you were able to witness her terrifying ability...",
  str_files_story_des_10306 = "Why did the mysterious person repair the damaged part of the Colossus? Was it just a game, or was the Illumina Federation testing their latest equipment!?",
  str_files_story_des_10307 = "The mysterious Faust you once met on the Aviduz has appeared again on the Colossus, with a background check report on himself to boot...",
  str_files_story_des_10308 = "Before going to Eraveil, you and Vice decide to visit Vivian in hospital, but Vice's purse suddenly disappears somewhere along the way... Was it stolen?",
  str_files_story_des_20100 = "To be added",
  str_files_story_des_20101 = "Out of the blue, Gronru challenges you to a game. If you lose, she'll do something \"extraneous\" to the Colossus.",
  str_files_story_des_20200 = "Hiiro invites you to go sightseeing in Gannon City and gives you a strange note. She also tells you about the story between the Illumina Generals and the note.",
  str_files_story_des_20201 = "Following an Illumina meeting, Barton approaches you and explains the situation... Turns out he's concerned that the other three generals would try to recruit you.",
  str_files_story_des_20202 = "You merely ask Barton what the purpose of war is, but he forces you into playing a game of chess. After unreasonably declaring himself the victor, he reveals that victory is the sole purpose of war.",
  str_files_story_des_20203 = "You've been having trouble sleeping and Sharona proposed a solution she's good at to help you. Although her solution is a little rough round the edges, it's simple and effective, and can resolve the problem for good.",
  str_files_story_des_20204 = "You returned to your room to find that someone had left you a mysterious note. Through your psychic ability, you sensed that it was related to Hiiro. During your confrontation with Hiiro, the truth gradually surfaced.",
  str_files_story_des_20205 = "Wrath seems troubled during her stay in the Colossus. The mood turns bizarre when you approach her, and a chase ensues in the dark.",
  str_files_story_des_20300 = "Do you indulge yourself in false happiness, or are you satisfied with painful reality? Wispy has opened its arms. From this, we can see a sliver of the truth of the True Order.",
  str_files_story_des_20301 = "If you must know what tomorrow will bring no matter what, Victoria shall comply.",
  str_files_story_des_20302 = "It's not easy taking care of Faust's suitcase, especially when it behaves exactly like a cat.",
  str_files_story_des_20303 = "A true gourmand can devour anything, whether it's a mound of meat, vines, sand, or mud, except carrots...",
  str_files_story_des_20304 = "Nails is standing silently on the Colossus, looking rather pale and thin. The look in his eyes is equally tranquil, as if nothing in the world could break his composure. But maybe it's all just a facade...",
  str_files_story_des_20400 = "On a whim, the Navigator decides to go to the Cafe to order something from Connolly, only to encounter Leona and Hydrad along the way. The two are arguing because of a language-related conflict, and physical clashes between them are rather common in the Colossus. The Navigator asks Connolly for help to resolve the confusion.",
  str_files_story_des_20401 = "You've been losing sleep and on edge from strange noises in your dream. Connolly offers a diagnosis based on her own experience, until the source emerges...",
  str_files_story_des_20402 = "Hydrad was surprised to see you and his attitude toward Kleken soured after hearing that you didn't go to Lumopolis. You realized that Hydrad and Kleken didn't seem to get along. When you asked him, Hydrad started to tell you a story...",
  str_files_story_des_20403 = "You discover that Shadow Wolf has been sneaking into your room during the night. But when you confront Hydrad, he refuses to do anything about it.",
  str_files_story_des_20404 = "As a witness, Jane watches all in silence, but without realizing everyone around her is also a witness to her heart of gold under a cold exterior.",
  str_files_story_des_20405 = "Leona is usually inseparable from Sunstone. But lately, the little dragon has been absent, and that's not the only thing missing...",
  str_files_story_des_20500 = "It's the Fiery Support concert! Rock music, and fiery passionate singing! Recruiting audience for the live concert! Please contact Jomu to register!",
  str_files_story_des_20501 = "In order to thoroughly destroy that arrogant Barbara, Regina's song must be perfect and astounding!!",
  str_files_story_des_20502 = "The Tiny One's latest inventions include the Extreme Regina Death Rock Wake-Up Call, Super Rocket Cooker, and Super Cool Spotlight.",
  str_files_story_des_20503 = "Odi's schedule is fuller than full. The stress will inevitably overwhelm her and she will...",
  str_files_story_des_20504 = "Beautiful sunset glows in the transparent bottle like a dream. Barbara would love this and reciprocate in kind.",
  str_files_story_des_20506 = "\"There's no such thing as a free meal in life.\" Although Jomu's mysterious gift looks cheap and affordable, the price has clearly been marked up already.",
  str_files_story_des_20600 = "To be added",
  str_files_story_des_20601 = "Louise, who once lived alone in the Northland Palace, met Noah who was traveling everywhere one day. This seems to be a story about how they met.",
  str_files_story_des_20602 = "Louise told you a new fairy tale because you've been having trouble sleeping lately, and even brought you some pudding she made herself. However, something seemed to be off about the fragrant pudding in front of you...",
  str_files_story_des_20603 = "Bethlehem asked you to monitor Louise and Noah's studies, but you ended up getting \"burned\"...",
  str_files_story_des_20604 = "You asked Nikinis if she could give you some flowers to calm your nerves. As you requested, Nikinis prepared a lot of fresh flowers for you... except she seemed to have misunderstood the quantity you need...",
  str_files_story_des_20605 = "You consult the self-proclaimed \"Know-It-All\" Noah regarding the data on Aurorian abilities. She uses her powers to give you a set of supposedly flawless data, but the truth is far from it...",
  str_files_story_des_20606 = "Noah, who had come to help you clean up, turned out to be a neat freak and spent most of the day wiping the same part of the wall because of a small stain. As a result, you decided to try it yourself.",
  str_files_story_des_20607 = "To improve her relationship with the others aboard the Colossus, Ophina has begun rigorously training herself to allow other people to touch her horn. In order to make progress, she needs a helping hand from the Navigator.",
  str_files_story_des_20700 = "To be added",
  str_files_story_des_20701 = "You look for the legendary Flashing Bouncing Fellow when you run into Joanie Boom and Rabbie in a quarrel. They force you to judge their bizarre reasoning, and you soon realize the Flashing Bouncing Fellow you're looking for is...",
  str_files_story_des_20702 = "Maggie is practically out of her mind looking for something. But upon learning, she probably has to search a lot of places, her normal shy self uncharacteristically...",
  str_files_story_des_20800 = "To be added",
  str_files_story_des_20801 = "Amy wanted to patrol the Colossus like a proper Hall of Justice Knight to help solve everyone's troubles. Her efforts were not very effective even though she had been trying really hard, so she asked you for help...",
  str_files_story_des_20802 = "Something big must be up with the Colossus for the Chief Judge of Lumopolis to show up in person! What is going on?",
  str_files_story_des_20803 = "Michenny is handing out verdicts again, but this time it's probably gone too far...",
  str_files_story_des_20900 = "To be added",
  str_files_story_des_20901 = "Has Raphael discovered the secret of the Colossus? She wants to heal the Colossus? It turns out that Raphael once treated a friend similar to the Colossus in the past...",
  str_files_story_des_20902 = "Although she can control flames, Uriel is often quite pessimistic. Can you bring her warmth?",
  str_files_story_des_20903 = "Gabriel's \"Slow and steady wins the race\" confuses you, but it's good to take a break every now and then.",
  str_files_story_des_20904 = "Through sheer luck, you give a Daybreak Crystal to Michael and touch her girlish heart.",
  str_files_story_des_21000 = "Suddenly, a magical poetry selection event is taking place on the Colossus! As one of the judges, whose poetry do you prefer?",
  str_files_story_des_21001 = "You ask the Keating Choir which are the boys and which are the girls, but the quartet will only tell you if you pass their test.",
  str_files_story_des_21002 = "While Schwartz was resting, Keating stuck a flower in his ear as a prank. A fuming Schwartz wants you to deal with this, and a special investigation is born out of the joint effort...",
  str_files_story_des_21003 = "You take the initiative to persuade the Keating Choir to mind their speaking manners. Sensing how hard you are trying, the children are touched enough to still reject you.",
  str_files_story_des_21004 = "A melody suddenly plays late at night, accompanied for some reason by a faint cry, only to stop at the crescendo.",
  str_files_story_des_21005 = "Strange white flowers are found planted in the Colossus. You discover it's the work of Uriah, but why and what for?",
  str_files_story_des_21100 = "The Istvan Gang sent three letters to you and asked you to meet them with one of the letters. After recording all the information from your investigation, you make your final decision...",
  str_files_story_des_21101 = "Kleken invites you in a roundabout way to play a game of predictions. You don't realize his true intent until the very end...",
  str_files_story_des_21102 = "Kleken invites you to play Dibury's Map that he received as a gift, and tells you a marvelous story about him and the Map.",
  str_files_story_des_21104 = "Drink this! Whereas lies are sweet and palatable, Loyalty & Honesty is extremely bitter.",
  str_files_story_des_21105 = "The Cafe has been turned on its head, as food from the pantry has gone missing. It turns out Seleucid was the first to arrive at the scene of the crime, making him a prime suspect...",
  str_files_story_des_21106 = "Remembering the time you played hide-and-seek with Patty and Patsy, you recall them singing a strange, even disturbing song... But after hearing it, you remember feeling reassured, as well.",
  str_files_story_des_21200 = "The courtroom? A trial? Is there a criminal in the Illumina Federation Support Division? What is the truth?",
  str_files_story_des_21201 = "Vivian is always so busy, even on the Colossus, but she became weird after receiving a beverage to reward her for her hard work...",
  str_files_story_des_21202 = "Vivian has prepared a wonderful gift to repay generosity, but are you ready for her kindness?",
  str_files_story_des_21204 = "The always glamorous Charon has turned enigmatic lately and taken an interest in Firefly. But why?",
  str_files_story_des_21205 = "Through a chance encounter, you discover Vice is undertaking a difficult project. Can you help her finish it?",
  str_files_story_des_21206 = "The General Inspector of Illumina suddenly gives you a task—delivering a gift. Is that all there is to it?",
  str_files_story_des_21207 = "Whether it's Philyshy or Yumi, cheese seems to be their nemesis that drives them crazy. What did cheese ever do to them?",
  str_files_story_des_21300 = "Schwartz disappears for one hour every week. What does he do during this time?",
  str_files_story_des_21301 = "Nadine suddenly told you that she wanted to do something for you. You were touched by her hard work and thoughtfulness until she apologized to you, and you found out the reason...",
  str_files_story_des_21302 = "You're curious about Ms. Blanc's \"Guide\" identity, but never expect to pique Ms. Blanc's interest in your Navigator status. Thus begins a round of juxtaposition.",
  str_files_story_des_21303 = "After finding a Firefly Carrier, Carleen became very interested in the \"mother\" who raised you, and is finally willing to share memories of her mother...",
  str_files_story_des_21304 = "As you stroll by Schwartz, he stops you.",
  str_files_story_des_21400 = "Where is the end of the desert? Where are the Loose Screws heading?",
  str_files_story_des_21401 = "The legendary Demon Scourge is the epitome of evil that destroys everything in her wake and has a hefty 500-million-dollar bounty on her head.",
  str_files_story_des_21402 = "The missing Franz is the cause of Kafka's worries and Navigator's bafflement. Where could the loyal black puppy be?",
  str_files_story_des_21403 = "Size, height, and weight are all absolutely important... And that's why even a difference of 1 pound is unacceptable. To right a grievous wrong, Sork is challenging Kuma yet again...",
  str_files_story_des_21404 = "After buying a large amount of counterfeit goods from Jomu, Brock is trying to find him and demand an explanation, only to get tricked into buying a strange, new product. Not even the Navigator could save him now...",
  str_files_story_des_21500 = "Migard discovered that a High-Level Eclipsite has infiltrated the Colossus and locked the target in the Cafe. To obtain important information from the Eclipsite, you find several master interrogators and find out...",
  str_files_story_des_21501 = "To figure out who is stronger, Benny and Curo have decided to give you a \"friendly\" interrogation. Faced with their questioning, you tell them exactly what is on your mind: why is it so important to distinguish who is strong and who is weak? Shouldn't they focus less on that and more on teamwork and learning from each other?",
  str_files_story_des_21502 = "After receiving more and more grievances about Migard, you have no choice but to confront her about the issue—her unacceptable behavior towards others has become a huge risk! By the end, however, it seems like you've become the sacrificial lamb for everyone...",
  str_files_story_des_21503 = "Strange sounds keep coming from inside Eicy's room. Mustering up every ounce of courage in your body, you ask her about it... And she decides to bring you into her room!",
  str_files_story_des_21504 = "Corax received your gift, and it seems to have brought back memories of when he was a doctor.",
  str_files_story_des_21600 = "A strange tape that allows people to see things they are thinking of? How will Tessa, Sariel, and Areia face this?",
  str_files_story_des_21601 = "Tessa received your Lumowhistler, but your present seems to have brought up some bad memories...",
  str_files_story_des_21603 = "Areia wants to buy a brand-new dress but hasn't been able to do so due to countless reasons. It turns out that she's even more cursed than everyone has realized...",
  str_files_story_des_21604 = "Sariel, who has gone to great lengths to investigate the mysterious death of her grandfather, would like to talk to you. So what does Gabriel, an Angel of Lumopolis, have to do with any of it?",
  str_files_story_des_21700 = "Three stories for three people, or three stories for one person? Is it one or is it three? Or maybe...",
  str_files_story_des_21701 = "Sikare tells you a strange tale, but judging from both its contents and Sikare's attitude towards it, there seems to be more to the story than meets the eye...",
  str_files_story_des_21702 = "Beverly tells you a story about her ancestors and their noble spirit. Hearing about it fills you with a sense of admiration and a sense of awkwardness, as well.",
  str_files_story_des_21703 = "Constantine tells you yet another hunting story from his Eclipsite-hunting days in Northland. Only this time, everything about his story is disturbingly out of the ordinary...",
  str_files_story_des_21800 = "Sinsa suddenly invites you to a celebration held by Rediesel Wrench and hints that he'll need to you take care of Dawn. When you arrive, you find out that this celebration is held to welcome your arrival.",
  str_files_story_des_21801 = "Why is Eve looking for things like gunpowder and sulfur in the middle of the night? What could she be up to?",
  str_files_story_des_21802 = "Sinsa, the leader of the Rediesel Wrench, has suddenly brought up an unexpected question: what's something that perfectly represents the Rediesel Wrench? After a lengthy (and painful) discussion, you realize Sinsa's goal is to prepare a gift for a certain someone...",
  str_files_story_des_21803 = "Something seems to be bothering Dawn lately. Maybe you should go help her out...",
  str_files_story_des_21900 = "The Covenant of the Hidden Moon is upon us. Dear Nameless, go and select a good book to read with us under the pale moonlight.",
  str_files_story_des_21901 = "Nightmares constantly plague Beryl's mind. Only when she brushes her hands over a book can she enjoy a moment of peace...",
  str_files_story_des_21902 = "A pair of eyes stare back at you from the bottom of a glass, but all you see is an eternally unfulfilled shadow.",
  str_files_story_des_21903 = "At 8:30 tonight, at the Cadenza Concert Hall, you will witness the most mysterious, beautiful, and greatest symphony the world has ever seen!",
  str_files_story_des_23001 = "You unintentionally encountered Dayna who had just returned from a fight. You were worried that she would get hurt, but she taught you some professional knowledge about fighting instead. However, Dayna started to panic when Robyn arrived, because the reason she was hurt was that Robyn...",
  str_files_story_des_23101 = "Standing two meters away, you try to help Robyn pick a good gift for Dayna. No matter how you look at it, Robyn seems to have a strange taste for gifts...",
  str_files_story_des_23201 = "You decide to confront Mia about her other personality, Baba Yaga, that has been bullying you recently, but then realize that Baba Yaga did that only because you had provoked someone you shouldn't have.",
  str_files_story_des_23301 = "Cuscuta has been waking up earlier and returning later than usual. Out of concern, you ask if anything is wrong, and she brings you to see... her gravestone?!",
  str_files_story_des_23401 = "Taki has taken an odd request: to search for a golden sandworm. Together with him, you head to the Rediesel Desert, the sandworm motherland, hoping to find one of these elusive, priceless creatures... only to find that Brock has taken one and ground it into shiny, golden protein powder?!",
  str_files_story_des_23501 = "A magnet for everyone's overwhelming admiration, Fleur has once again sunk into a mire of doubt. Is there any way to comfort him?",
  str_files_story_des_23601 = "People seem to form a bad impression of Smokey from the moment they meet her, and so a plan to improve her public image begins...",
  str_files_story_des_23701 = "Gram quickly identifies your affliction and promptly administers the appropriate medicine. In the end, the results are truly satisfactory.",
  str_files_story_des_23801 = "A mysterious wooden sign appears on the Colossus, bearing the words \"All ye brave enough to challenge the Colossus' mightiest, touch this sign, if you dare!\" What in the world could possibly be going on here?",
  str_files_story_des_23901 = "You accidentally break one of Allura's precious pieces, but her reaction is not quite as you expected...",
  str_files_story_des_24001 = "You discuss a book with Paloma aboard the Colossus, and she tells you a story that sounds both familiar and beyond belief...",
  str_files_story_des_24101 = "Naroxel brings an assortment of potted plants to the Colossus. You pick out a cactus and place it in your bedroom, but something strange happens a few days later...",
  str_files_story_des_24201 = "Tweety suddenly asks what type of girls you're interested in. You wonder what kinds of strange ideas have been filling this innocent young girl's mind recently...",
  str_files_story_des_24301 = "You accidentally receive a copy of Jane's records regarding Bethel's hobbies, and she seems intent to destroy all evidence of its existence...",
  str_files_story_des_24401 = "After the White Flame Mercenaries' Bartering Day, you feel like you're finally getting to know more about Luke.",
  str_files_story_des_24501 = "Pittman suddenly comes up to you with a pair of sunglasses... What could have happened to make him behave so out of character?",
  str_files_story_des_24601 = "Recently, a secret collection of paintings has been traded throughout the Aurorian world. It is said that the collection consists solely of your paintings, and the producers of this collection are two Aurorians in suits...",
  str_files_story_des_24701 = "You simply wanted to ask what Jomu and Hedy were discussing, but have now been inexplicably dragged into a baffling battle of wits...",
  str_files_story_des_24801 = "Illumina Sheriff Cordy has missed a lot of work due to an unfortunate accident. Will you help her by temporarily handling her affairs?",
  str_files_story_des_24901 = "In your hunger, you found a honey cake baked by Lola, but she wanted you to do something for her before you could have it...",
  str_files_story_des_25001 = "An amazing mind reader has come to the Colossus and you wonder how he did it...",
  str_files_story_des_25101 = "Siobhan seems to be hiding something. I need to ask her about it.",
  str_files_story_des_25201 = "Erica seems to always be hearing strange noises on the Colossus. What could it be...?",
  str_files_story_des_25301 = "Why are there so many things in Ruby's bag that don't belong to her? Well, she doesn't have an answer either...",
  str_files_story_des_25401 = "Florine came to me in a rush for something urgent.",
  str_files_story_des_25501 = "Rouge needed my help and wanted to meet in the lounge as soon as possible.",
  str_files_story_des_25601 = "That day, the Kagura Bell rang, and Rinne taught you the customs of Cloud Island...",
  str_files_story_des_25701 = "Kayano has been sneaking around lately as if she's hiding something...",
  str_files_story_des_25801 = "Amemori seems to be having special ninja training in the Lounge. Go take a look?",
  str_files_story_des_25901 = "Yao tells you about how she traveled the world to upholding justice.",
  str_files_story_des_26001 = "Momo and Anzu contacted me, asking to discuss something cooking-related.",
  str_files_story_des_26101 = "Introduced by Hachi & Gin, a Mysterious Creature has come to the Colossus...",
  str_files_story_des_26201 = "Azure invited you to go for a ride together but pulled over outside a pub where a party was under way.",
  str_files_story_des_26301 = "Roy posted a request looking for an assistant to test his new invention. The reward money was very tempting.",
  str_files_story_des_26401 = "Lenore wants to make a plush toy and is searching for materials...",
  str_files_story_des_26501 = "The Navigator runs into Giles on the Colossus and gets involved in the story he's writing.",
  str_files_story_des_26601 = "May sends a strange message from through the Terminal, it must be something important...",
  str_files_story_des_26701 = "An opportunity to experience Reinhardt's life for a day? But it turns out quite differently from what you imagined...",
  str_files_story_des_26801 = "With her newly discovered power, Vice is troubled by the possibility of losing all her emotions. To solve her problem, you and a few friends plan a test...",
  str_files_story_des_26901 = "Barton seems to be acting rather strangely ever since he gained new power in Eraveil. Hopefully, it is just your imagination...",
  str_files_story_des_27001 = "Nina invites you to taste one of her \"delicacies\" and tells you the story behind it.",
  str_files_story_des_27101 = "Sanae is about to take her final exam at the Maid Cram School, but the conditions of the exam seem a little suspicious...",
  str_files_story_des_27201 = "Carleen just handled a tricky smuggling case. Let's hear what it was about.",
  str_files_story_des_27301 = "Ciel carefully made many plans, hoping to invite you to go to the sea with her while she pilots her dynamic mecha.",
  str_files_story_des_27401 = "Fia is standing in the middle of the corridor angrily and Kyllo is nowhere to be seen. What on earth happened?",
  str_files_story_des_27501 = "The triplets, Merylt, Subli and Frimet, organize a special interview... What will Jeno's answer be?",
  str_files_story_des_27601 = "Rainbow asked you to take the circus out for a performance, but she feels under the weather when you get here...",
  str_files_story_des_27701 = "Pollux asks you to take her shopping in Umbraton, but she's actually planning something.",
  str_files_story_des_27801 = "Casta invites you to a casino. How is she planning to show that she's blessed by luck? Intriguing.",
  str_files_story_des_27901 = "At your request, Irridon takes you to Judge's office. He's asleep, however, and is talking in his sleep...",
  str_files_story_des_28001 = "On the basis that getting back in touch with one's roots could inspire creativity, you brought Lilica back to the hometown she's left behind for years...",
  str_files_story_des_28101 = "Minos invited you to a party near the Andersen Mansion, where Mr. Androma will make an important announcement.",
  str_files_story_des_28201 = "Sadie, in search of true swashbuckling spirit, provided you with very timely assistance, yet she remained lost in finding her way... How will you repay her?",
  str_files_story_des_28301 = "Axelia wants to know what it feels like to lose. Will she get her to wish and experience it first-hand?",
  str_files_story_des_28401 = "Beretta is meant to give a medical lecture in Umbraton on behalf of the Lumopolis Medical Academy, but the residents there don't seem to welcome her.",
  str_files_story_des_28501 = "Goldie has been suffering from insomnia recently. After finding out what is troubling her, you decide to solve the problem together.",
  str_files_story_des_28601 = "Vic has received a challenge from another extrozoologist! However, he doesn't seem fazed at all. Is he really that confident...?",
  str_files_story_des_28701 = "In order to keep her from losing her job, you agree to give Brandy another personal interview. However, her notetaking technique causes some unforeseen complications...",
  str_files_story_des_28801 = "Zhong Xu invites you to visit Twin Pavilions Bay, and you prepare to go with great enthusiasm...",
  str_files_story_des_28901 = "You and Yuebai arrive at the business district of Twin Pavilions Bay with separate goals in mind, but you both end up being cheated by the same merchant...",
  str_files_story_des_29001 = "Liqing has his hands full with a wayward patient, but he won't give up so easily.",
  str_files_story_des_29101 = "Vice complains that the letter she sent to the Rediesel Wrench was never received. She seems to be looking for Jeriah to ask her why...",
  str_files_story_des_29201 = "Seeing how heavy Kya's letter bag is, you volunteer to accompany her as she delivers the mail but end up meeting a weeping recipient...",
  str_files_story_des_29301 = "Tina describes to you what happened in a dream of hers, but it seems to be more than just a simple reverie...",
  str_files_story_des_29401 = "All young girls with romantic hearts have once dreamt of being rescued by a dashing hero. This kind of fantasy, however, doesn't seem to be in the cards for Leyn.",
  str_files_story_des_29501 = "You and Matthieu attend a gathering held by the ex-convicts. Unfortunately, Matthieu's tactless words irritate everyone present and drag you into a sticky situation...",
  str_files_story_des_29601 = "Hati met a strange mother and daughter by chance in Umbraton. Although the daughter couldn't speak, she liked Hati a lot, and the mother actually let entrusted her daughter to Hati...",
  str_files_story_des_29701 = "Kristen gave you a ticket to an opera show, so you decided to watch the show at an opera house in Lumopolis...",
  str_files_story_des_35001 = "Yingel invites you to visit the Illumina War Room. She seems to have something to share with you.",
  str_files_story_des_35002 = "Due to the shortage of supplies for the Ironthorn Knights, Leo leads a team to venture into the depth of the Dark Zone. On their way, the team meets a group of fleeing civilians that needs assistance, and Leo has to make his choice.",
  str_files_story_des_35003 = "That day, Anatoli finds you and asks you to retrieve a book he left in the Lounge.",
  str_files_story_des_35004 = "While gazing into the distance, Schwartz seems to have stumbled upon a long-forgotten corner of his memory...",
  str_files_story_des_35005 = "It doesn't matter if you're shy or clumsy, someone as hardworking and sincere as you will always have admirers.",
  str_files_story_des_35006 = "Jakine foretells that someone in the Rediesel Desert needs help, but her divinations are usually unreliable, and she's even always losing her crystal ball. Can she really step up this time?",
  str_files_story_des_35007 = "While traveling brings new and exciting experiences, it also allows you to find familiar things in strangers.",
  str_files_story_des_35008 = "The Fireflies are cleaning Ms. Blanc's work clothes for her, but nothing has been able to remove the stains on her skirt. What could it be?",
  str_files_story_des_35009 = "You happen to encounter Cena, enjoying a meal at the Colossus Cafe, and engage in a lively discussion about food and other topics.",
  str_files_story_des_35010 = "Bopper calls you to Denuo Valley, saying she's got some good stuff to share with you. What could it be?",
  str_files_story_des_35011 = "Lorelei's usually all smiles, but she's been sighing a lot lately. Think she's got some troubles?",
  str_files_story_des_35012 = "In a room on the Colossus, the Navigator spots a piece of paper with an uncanny familiarity—certain unpleasant memories crawl up their spine. The first thing the Navigator does, rather than flipping the paper to check the back, is to cast a glance around, seeking the figure that might show up at any moment. However, unexpectedly, the expected scene fails to materialize...",
  str_files_story_des_35013 = [[
On a rare tranquil morning, the Navigator gets a request for assistance from Joselyne, saying that Joselyne, in order to attend the appointment, needs to complete her daily preparations earlier than usual.
After a bustling morning, Joselyne invites you to journey together to the place you agreed upon...]],
  str_files_story_des_35014 = "Fueled by his powerful thirst for knowledge, Antony has been studying the fireflies, hoping to unravel the secrets they hide.",
  str_files_story_des_35015 = "Zarya has recently been studying how to aim accurately with Vice. Now, here comes the question—has her ability to control her Luminatics actually improved?",
  str_files_story_des_35016 = "No. 33 is clearly not very familiar with other Aurorians, but is currently formulating a plan to make some new friends and urgently needs your help.",
  str_files_story_des_35017 = "Fafnir has been playing games all day. Go check on him.",
  str_files_story_des_35018 = "Kanna showed me her sketch diary. I could tell she put a lot of effort into it!",
  str_files_story_des_35019 = "The revisiting Tohru is making you a special dish.",
  str_files_story_des_35020 = "Elma suddenly gets the idea of looking for a job on the Colossus, but what's the true story here?",
  str_files_story_des_35021 = "A healthy routine is very important, so stop burning the midnight oil!",
  str_files_story_des_35022 = "Rebecca refuses to let anyone into her room. Clearly, she doesn't wish for the secrets within to be known...",
  str_files_story_des_35023 = "Isa has noticed how busy Rebecca has been with the clinic and wishes to ask you where she should take her for a relaxing trip. However, being her sister, her concerns are a little too complicated...",
  str_files_story_des_35024 = "Xuan Ji invited the Navigator to have a meal together to thank the Navigator for helping her out earlier. Coincidentally, the Navigator also had lots of interesting things to share about mechanical craftsmanship. The two hit it off instantly and chatted while eating.",
  str_files_story_des_35025 = "Istvan has sent a cryptic message. He probably ran into a problem he couldn't tell anyone around him.",
  str_files_story_des_35026 = "It seems Vergil wants to go to the antique market in Umbraton but is too scared to go by himself...",
  str_files_story_des_35027 = "Hard to believe the renowned Cloudrover Guildmaster has bad debts on hand.",
  str_files_story_des_35028 = "To complete an era-changing invention, Algol wants you to help her with an experiment...",
  str_files_story_des_35029 = "Chen'ni is eager to check out the novelties of the Astra continent, so you take her to Umbraton...",
  str_files_story_des_35030 = "Luo Song has accepted his first task to handle fiendling in Astra; what's in store for him?",
  str_files_story_des_35031 = "As crisis looms over the Snowpine Forest, Tiare seeks PlayerName's aid, and together they lay a trap...",
  str_files_story_des_35032 = "Rachel has been taking oral supplements instead of eating recently, and the Caelestite is shocked upon learning about this...",
  str_files_story_des_35033 = "Zeta looks really eager and enthusiastic these days. Could she be up to something?",
  str_files_story_des_30001 = "In an attempt to save the Colossus from bankruptcy, Vice once again dives into her field of expertise—cooking. But what kind of aftertaste will her next dish leave behind?",
  str_files_story_des_30002 = "No longer afraid of the unknown, she now witnesses the beauty of the sea with her own eyes. All she needs is for you to hold her hand.",
  str_files_story_des_30003 = "In an illusory fortress lies a complex heart, enacting a fictional tale that reflects his reality.",
  str_files_story_des_30004 = "All the money in the world cannot buy happiness, but a priceless gift can alleviate one's troubles.",
  str_files_story_des_30005 = "The sound of the wind, the birds, and the waves—a romantic symphony of the seashore in summer, preserved in the winding passages of a conch, and echoing words of gratitude.",
  str_files_story_des_30006 = "Barton embarks on a journey to expand Illumina's Navy...",
  str_files_story_des_30007 = "Rumor has it that, at this time of year, Sharona changes into a special outfit and sets off for a mystery location. This time, an opportunity to uncover the secret of her annual ritual presents itself to you...",
  str_files_story_des_30008 = "Hiiro stares at an old photo and recalls the past. The photo is a snapshot of the way she once was—how can you help her to celebrate this special memory?",
  str_files_story_des_30009 = "Vice seems to have found something belonging to you... something related to a distant memory. As she lights the fireworks, you wonder why she seems so different from her usual self...",
  str_files_story_des_30010 = "You run into Jane on the streets of Umbraton, but suddenly hear a scream in the distance, coming from the orphanage... What could possibly have happened?",
  str_files_story_des_30011 = "Philyshy flies into a sudden rage! You and Vice look at each other in shock—the source of her anger seems completely oblivious, and sits on the ground, licking his paws while meowing innocently.",
  str_files_story_des_30012 = "Though rainy weather does not make for the best flight conditions, the injured bird still shakes its wings. Perhaps the direction in which it flies is also the direction of Tessa's heart...",
  str_files_story_des_30013 = "Migard devotes all she has to her work and research, even when she is resting...",
  str_files_story_des_30014 = "Pact seems to have gotten her hand on an outfit that looks exactly like Victoria's. What could she possibly be planning to do with it?",
  str_files_story_des_30015 = "You suddenly received an invitation to see Charon's grand performance! As an indescribable atmosphere mounts, you decide to go along as promised...",
  str_files_story_des_30016 = "As the time to say goodbye arrives, the pitter-patter of raindrops quietly accompanies your farewell. Will we see such a scene again, when next summer comes around?",
  str_files_story_des_30017 = "Areia got a wondrous magical dress, but what will happen to it when the clock strikes midnight?",
  str_files_story_des_30018 = "You got an odd gift on New Year's Day. The giant box would sometimes tremble, with occasional stifled coughs...",
  str_files_story_des_30019 = "You found Nikinis, who ran away from a party, deep in thought and staring at the water alone by Lake Mirror.",
  str_files_story_des_30020 = "Victoria has a mirror, but when you look into it, you realize it's not your reflection.",
  str_files_story_des_30021 = "Louise and Noah staked out some kind of Northland crossroads with you, just to see the fabled carriage that never rests...",
  str_files_story_des_30022 = "Sometimes, what you need to solve your problems is three cups and the right coffee shop.",
  str_files_story_des_30023 = "Nadine put on her new clothes and took her duty in the Colossus seriously, but you wish she would rest a little more.",
  str_files_story_des_30024 = "To expand your knowledge, you bought some courses, but you didn't expect to see a familiar face—Sariel, as your lecturer.",
  str_files_story_des_30025 = "Uriel engaged in a series of literary debates with you under the setting sun... And you got to learn a little more about Uriel.",
  str_files_story_des_30026 = "Maggie pedaled her bicycle furiously under the bright sun, taking off into the air and hitting the oblivious Chainsaw Rick...",
  str_files_story_des_30027 = "Eve got a strange outfit from somewhere and wants to wear it to cheer everyone on at the Rediesel Wrench's Popularity Contest.",
  str_files_story_des_30028 = "For the first time, Carleen showed a mixed look of shock, unease, anger, bashfulness, and adorable shyness.",
  str_files_story_des_30029 = "Wrath suddenly invites you to go shopping at Koufu-jou. Is this considered a so-called... date?",
  str_files_story_des_30030 = "It's a rare holiday and Tweety invites everyone to play hanetsuki with her. It's also said that those who lose have to accept some kind of punishment...",
  str_files_story_des_30031 = "Who wouldn't covet the scent of cherry blossoms?",
  str_files_story_des_30032 = "\"Shinnosuke embarks on a journey of eradicating evil in exchange for his sister Eve's well-being...\" Is this the novel that's currently trending in the East?",
  str_files_story_des_30033 = "You met Irridon by chance at Koufu-jou's station, but ended up being interrogated...",
  str_files_story_des_30034 = "Chandra's psychotherapy worked like magic... How would it feel to release all those deeply buried emotions?",
  str_files_story_des_30035 = "What outfit did Bethel pick for Istvan? Can't wait to see him in it.",
  str_files_story_des_30036 = "Connolly agreed to be the race queen for, but the first step seemed impossible for her...",
  str_files_story_des_30037 = "A girl selling dolls told a fantastic story about the Magic Dragon Referee... Hang on a minute. The referee sounds a lot like...",
  str_files_story_des_30038 = "A hot day, a tight corner, a very exciting event... How would Taki do in the race?",
  str_files_story_des_30039 = "Upon Raphael's invite, you arrive at a manor, but they have a unique way of welcoming their visitors...",
  str_files_story_des_30040 = "Her heart has never pounded so furiously.",
  str_files_story_des_30041 = "Louise invites you to play pretend with her. What roles will the two of you take on?",
  str_files_story_des_30042 = "Alice's cake gets stolen and she's determined to punish the thief herself!",
  str_files_story_des_30043 = "Fleur is in search of a place to bake bread... How strange! Is he considering a career change?",
  str_files_story_des_30044 = "Brock puts on a special new outfit just to find a certain item. It is said that this look allows Brock to move even faster than usual.",
  str_files_story_des_30045 = "You and Leona go to the beach to have some fun, but unexpectedly, you run into the person she wants to see the least...",
  str_files_story_des_30046 = "Smokey transformed into a mysterious phantom thief of the night and stole a priceless gemstone... However, it seems that the gemstone wasn't the only item stolen.",
  str_files_story_des_30047 = "Gronru has developed a new game. If you can't pass it, you will have to pay her a hefty sum for the Colossus' repairs...",
  str_files_story_des_30048 = "The released Rainy Flapper soon vanishes in the air, but Luke has a way to preserve this beautiful moment forever.",
  str_files_story_des_30049 = "When Beverly shows up on the beach in her new outfit, a new legend is born.",
  str_files_story_des_30050 = "You wish to help Ms. Blanc and become her temporary agent. But this job doesn't seem easy.",
  str_files_story_des_30051 = "Someone is asking you to deliver 100 crates of alcohol to a location. But the requester was...",
  str_files_story_des_30052 = "You ran into Wendy hawking newspapers in Umbraton and striving to pad her sales.",
  str_files_story_des_30053 = "Sikare not only dutifully watched over the \"crypt\" but also listened to the voices of the dead inside.",
  str_files_story_des_30054 = "Hedy was invited to be One-Day Sheriff in Gannon, but the work has never been smooth from the start...",
  str_files_story_des_30055 = "To get the legendary chili sauce, Revy went undercover in the Umbraton Prison. However, everything went opposite of what she expected...",
  str_files_story_des_30056 = "The Navigator received an unusual assignment to interview a famous actor...",
  str_files_story_des_30057 = "Paloma, leader of the Black Roses, agreed to let you assist her in exacting revenge on a Lumopolis noble, and a certain judge tracked her here...",
  str_files_story_des_30058 = "You're reading books with Queen Bethlehem on your day off and are surprised to find a notebook filled with Shaya's fantasies from many years ago...",
  str_files_story_des_30059 = "You are invited to journey to Northland. Early in the morning, before the New Year, you awaken to the sound of the piano drifting through the halls of the Winter Palace and find Novio sitting behind the keys...",
  str_files_story_des_30060 = "In Gannon City, the popular urban legend of the Enforcer of Justice, also known as the Punisher, is on everyone's lips. They say that whenever evil strikes, a thunderclap pierces the air...",
  str_files_story_des_30061 = "Although their personalities are different, the Lilliams share a common goal, and are willing to give their all to achieve it.",
  str_files_story_des_30062 = "In order to avoid playing games with Gronru, Siobhan, who has always been concerned with nothing but scientific research, suddenly decides to participate in concert auditions...",
  str_files_story_des_30063 = "It is Mooncrown Day again. In the name of safeguarding the pure emotions of Astra's lovers, a flash of lightning shuttles through the streets...",
  str_files_story_des_30064 = "You and Pittman agreed to meet in front of the gates of Lumopolis. You arrive, as agreed...",
  str_files_story_des_30065 = "Chloe is invited to be a guest performer at a noble wedding, but her music touches the bride's heart in an unexpected way... Now, something shocking has happened! The bride has run away!",
  str_files_story_des_30066 = "As you walk through the streets of Umbraton, a brawny stranger suddenly emerges from the shadows and drags you to an underground salon. And somehow, Jeno is here too...",
  str_files_story_des_30067 = "Good hunters are often good at disguising themselves because the best way to corner prey with no way to escape is to make them lower their guard.",
  str_files_story_des_30068 = "You run into Fia, Vic, and Shira on the streets of Umbraton. They seem to be huddled up together and discussing something...",
  str_files_story_des_30069 = "You see Dayna on the street, so you want to approach her and say hi...",
  str_files_story_des_30070 = "Pengy and Kuma asked you to help them with something simple, but you had no idea this would result in you becoming a fugitive...",
  str_files_story_des_30071 = "During your travels, you come across a small town where you intend to restock supplies. However, to your surprise, the entire town turns hostile toward you. You find yourself being chased by the crazed townspeople, but in the chaos, you find Eicy is here too...",
  str_files_story_des_30072 = "You and Cuscuta work together to investigate the Umbraton serial murder case. Despite facing a terrifying murderer and a traumatized survivor, Cuscuta shows her way of compassion in the midst of danger.",
  str_files_story_des_30073 = "Gabriel is planning on visiting the Umbraton Orphanage to offer her condolences, and invites you to travel with her. And so, the two of you arrive in Umbraton...",
  str_files_story_des_30074 = "A grimoire of the dark arts falls into Keating's unwitting hands, and upon its very last page lies an alchemical incantation of unspeakably outrageous dread. And so, Keating gathers all of the necessary materials and embarks on their first foray into forbidden alchemy...",
  str_files_story_des_30075 = "In an attempt to show support for Leah's devotion to learning, Sylva dresses up in his finest threads. However, things don't go quite as he had planned...",
  str_files_story_des_30076 = "Everyone is panicking due to the recent spate of mysterious murders on Cloud Island. While investigating, Rinne learns that the murderer is a black cat...",
  str_files_story_des_30077 = "The malevolent ones claim the small yet thorny firethrons as sacred relics, placing them on the altar. But instead of blessings, it only brings forth punishment.",
  str_files_story_des_30078 = "Florine asks for your company as she embarks on a voyage, undertaking a secret quest for the Heretics Investigation Division...",
  str_files_story_des_30079 = "Stretching out on a beach chair, relishing the gentle sea breeze—Naroxel is finally released from the bustling work, savoring a serene moment in the seaside city.",
  str_files_story_des_30080 = "Michenny wants to send a Dunecat back to its desert hometown, but upon reaching the Rediesel Desert, she realizes things are not as easy as they seem...",
  str_files_story_des_40101 = "Together with Carleen, you step into Twin Pavilions Bay, a vibrant and lively harbor city. Little do you know, an unexpected someone will cross your path on this journey...",
  str_files_story_des_40102 = "You go to Twin Pavilions Bay to work and keep it from Vice. However, there, you encounter someone who seems oddly familiar.",
  str_files_story_des_40103 = "Patty and Patsy don oriental-style clothing, only to discover that these garments unexpectedly grant them special abilities...",
  str_files_story_des_40104 = "You go on a trip to the countryside with Eve, who comes across many dandelions scattered across the meadows. After a brief moment of reflection, she sends her wishes floating into the breeze along with the dandelions.",
  str_files_story_des_40105 = "Irridon invites you to meet someone she dares not face alone. Who exactly is it that makes the Chief Judge so fearful?",
  str_files_story_des_40107 = "After the celebration party for the successful publication of the novel, Areia asks PlayerName out for a walk along the beach. Under the genial sunshine, she seems to have something to pour out...",
  str_files_story_des_30081 = "As Queen Bethlehem graces the diplomatic event at the seaside, two dragons emerge out of nowhere, stirring up quite a commotion...",
  str_files_story_des_30082 = "Vic joins you on the journey underwater in quest of your innermost desire—gold. Amidst the sea's mysterious expanse, can you truly discover the treasure you seek?",
  str_files_story_des_30083 = "The eerie sound of a chiming clock echoes through the halls of Museum No.4. A word to the wise—never set foot in this museum at night, otherwise...",
  str_files_story_des_30084 = "A special kind of Eclipsite appears near Northland. Constantine decides to investigate the situation with the aid of PlayerName.",
  str_files_story_des_30085 = "Zarya arrives at the beach she once made a solemn agreement to visit, but the person she made this agreement with can no longer fulfill her end of the deal...",
  str_files_story_des_30086 = "Nina is getting ready for the 5th Gem Competition. In her quest for victory, she adorns herself with precious gems and takes the spotlight. Yet, the captured photos fail to meet her expectations.",
  str_files_story_des_30087 = "After hearing her talking about her dreams, PlayerName brought Connolly to the photography studio. Will she manage to prolong her dream?",
  str_files_story_des_30088 = "Kafka and PlayerName come to the desert racetrack to have training in physical strength. Here, Kafka is ready to introduce a new friend...",
  str_files_story_des_30089 = "Revy receives a strange letter. It reads, \"Do you want to protect the weak? Come to Illumina Research Lab then.\"",
  str_files_story_des_30090 = "After trekking a long way, Gram leads you to a beautiful and serene valley. Does he simply desire to take a leisurely stroll with you?",
  str_files_story_des_30091 = "Ciel is trapped in a collapsed cavern in an ice field. Will she be able to escape there this time?",
  str_files_story_des_30092 = "Dantang and Caelestite make plans to appreciate the moon and share a drink. However, as the conversation becomes more lively, the Caelestite falls asleep. In his dreams, there's the young Dantang...",
  str_files_story_des_30093 = "Nadine secures a part-time job in Twin Pavilions Bay. Every night, she patrols the coast with a palace lantern in hand. This time, she encounters Caelestite, who is out harvesting from the sea.",
  str_files_story_des_30094 = "Li Tianxian tries to persuade the fishing Caelestite perform divination, even resorting to sharing his past in the Dragon Palace?!",
  str_files_story_des_30095 = "Sariel is actually wearing asymmetrical clothes? She must have a reason for doing this...",
  str_files_story_des_30096 = "Lilica received an invitation to a charity performance. Now, she needs some help and encouragement...",
  str_files_story_des_30097 = "Pollux has to leave for a while, and the reason behind her departure turns out to be...",
  str_files_story_des_30098 = "Hiiro receives a letter from her grandmother, saying some unusual movements of Cloud Mountain's barrier have been noticed recently...",
  str_files_story_des_30099 = "Amidst the season of universal family reunions, Pasolo sits alone by the window, crafting paper butterflies to keep her company...",
  str_files_story_des_30100 = "Chancing upon Faust in Twin Pavilions Bay, he has acquired a stack of ancient books, seemingly engrossed in the study of Longzhou's ancient culture.",
  str_files_story_des_30101 = "Xuan Ji appears out of nowhere, saying she wants to use the Colossus to gaze upon the distant stars...",
  str_files_story_des_30102 = "Adras once dreamed of a bright future, which was now entirely forgotten. While you're crafting armor for him, he takes the opportunity and briefly recollects the fragments of that dream.",
  str_files_story_des_30103 = "Wounded in war, Axelia now lies in the hospital bed and sinks into pessimism as she watches the rose by her bedside. Seeing her frailty, PlayerName starts to explain the meaning of the rose to her...",
  str_files_story_des_30104 = "During the off-season at the Tir' Hotel, Fleur is invited by the boss to maintain and supervise equipment. PlayerName, recognized as \"family,\" is also invited to join...",
  str_files_story_des_30105 = "Uriel doesn't want to continue her gloomy life as an Aurorian. Thus, she drinks a special potion recorded in a forbidden tome, and now, what PlayerName has to face is...",
  str_files_story_des_30106 = "After accepting a request, PlayerName goes to Robyn's home to deliver some books to her. There, the two of them spend a lazy afternoon together...",
  str_files_story_des_30107 = "After accepting Sharona's request, PlayerName travels to a set of ruins littered with the remains of a dragon idol, and finds her dressed in ceremonial garments...",
  str_files_story_des_30108 = "Ever the prankster, Ansia now finds herself undergoing honor guard training as punishment for her shenanigans, and hopes that PlayerName can help her pass inspection...",
  str_files_story_des_30110 = "After Goldie wraps up her day of work as an idol, PlayerName, as her \"Manager for a Day,\" starts to enjoy a moment of their own...",
  str_files_story_des_30111 = "Pact has invited PlayerName to go ingredient shopping for her in Umbraton, but her real purpose is to...",
  str_files_story_des_30112 = "Tina invited Toto and me to a picnic. She even made new outfits for that. A rare outing, but did not go so well...",
  str_files_story_des_30113 = "Joanie Boom is in charge of the canteen today. As she knows absolutely nothing about cooking, she invites PlayerName over to try to talk to the ingredients with psychic abilities...",
  str_files_story_des_30114 = "To catch the cunning poachers, Hydrad has infiltrated their ranks alone and is relying on you to come with reinforcements.",
  str_files_story_des_30115 = "Yuebai wants to make the best river snail noodles. The first step is to catch some river snails...",
  str_files_story_des_30116 = "Longzhou's Festival of Colors is here, and Chen'ni has brought you with her to walk around the lively streets in search of a vague wish.",
  str_files_story_des_30117 = "After taking care of some business in the Rediesel Desert, PlayerName happens to encounter Yingel. However, she stubbornly claims that she isn't lost...",
  str_files_story_des_30118 = "At a celebrity banquet, your status as the Caelestite draws no small amount of unwanted attention. However, an angel soon descends to save you from your awkward dilemma—",
  str_files_story_des_30119 = "Barbara has chosen the stage for her latest performance, but the Rediesel idol is having trouble reaching her newest audience. Perhaps PlayerName can help her fill those seats...",
  str_files_story_des_30120 = "Sweet Rabbie has invited PlayerName to her snack stand, where she wants to provide a taste of the Rediesel Desert with service and smiles. But before doing so, she needs you to try something...",
  str_files_story_des_30121 = "In the splashing waves, Jeriah's already-scanty swimsuit is barely visible. Can PlayerName protect her privacy by defending this stretch of the beach?",
  str_files_story_des_40001 = "Dantang is flipping through a novel titled \"Great Zhao's Annals of the West.\" The story itself is really odd, but it doesn't seem to bother her at all.",
  str_files_story_des_40002 = "Tianxian says that Jabber, one of his starlings, has gone missing. Maybe we can find a clue to the missing bird's whereabouts in his Scroll of Divine Ascension...",
  str_files_story_des_35034 = "Batia feels really sad that bat demi-humans are often depicted as villains in games. Fortunately, Super Bat still exists.",
  str_files_story_des_30122 = "Pango, one of Barton's superiors long in a coma, has woken up. Barton called you to join them in reminiscing...",
  str_files_story_des_35035 = "A mysterious series of murder cases led to the darkest, most horrifying side of the True Order...",
  str_files_story_des_35036 = "Wilhelm takes you on a treasure hunt journey, and unearthed an old relic buried a hundred years ago...",
  str_files_story_des_35037 = "Nails is very concerned about a kind lady who once saved him and wants to confirm whether she lives happily.",
  str_files_story_des_35038 = "Ryza wants to craft the strongest weapon for you, but she runs into a little problem...",
  str_files_story_des_35039 = "According to Klaudia, \"Connections and information are the bread-and-butter of any seller,\" and she may very well be about to prove it.",
  str_files_story_des_35040 = "Patricia receives a flimsy book said to be quite \"thrilling,\" but what lies within its pages is...",
  str_files_story_des_30123 = "Jola lies on a reef in the shallows, white roses and petals floating on the sea. PlayerName came to handle complaints about him but got pulled into a philosophical discussion...",
  str_files_story_des_30124 = "Matthieu just wanted a quiet beach vacation, but you showed up \"inopportunely\" before him. What to do now?",
  str_files_story_des_30125 = "PlayerName hoped to invite Sikare to enjoy the summer with everyone, but her Black Box took you to a tomb. She awaits you there...",
  str_files_story_des_30126 = "At Tir' Hotel, Ryza is about to spend her last summer festival in Astra with friends.",
  str_files_story_des_30127 = "Even though the Grand Marshal granted her a special vacation, Rachel is still working like a maniac on the beach. How will PlayerName help her enjoy a beach holiday?",
  str_files_story_des_35041 = "Maya had a favor to ask PlayerName, but upon arriving at the agreed-upon location, she completely forgot the whole thing, as expected...",
  str_files_story_des_30131 = "PlayerName goes to Umbraton to go shopping but finds the shop closed. As a top-notch butler, Minos recommends a new shop, and there lies a story of Minos' past...",
  str_files_story_des_30128 = "A strange ceiling, a strange sickbed, and Corax taking care of you... Would you drink the \"nutrient supplement\" he specially made for you?",
  str_files_story_des_30130 = "In the misty luxury bathhouse, Sheol proposes to gift PlayerName a luxurious club. Is it a flirtatious tease, or is she being sincere?",
  str_files_story_des_30129 = "There are countless emotions in the world, corresponding to countless colors. Even when facing bandits, Lester still wants to show the reason for the vibrant colors is...",
  str_files_story_des_30132 = "The Northland Mirror has returned to Nikinis, but she still needs some courage to face the other side of the mirror again...",
  str_files_story_des_35042 = "Mithra's been looking a bit under the weather lately, probably because she hasn't been getting enough sleep. Even so, she still asks if there’s anything she can do...",
  str_files_story_des_30133 = "Achilles, learning to use the terminal, invites you to join the Star Warriors' banquet. It was a joyful night...",
  str_files_audio_author_1602411 = "Yui Ogura",
  str_files_basic_desc_1602411 = [[
Name: Pepita 
Nickname: Unbridled Maverick 
Gender: Female 
Height: 5'6"
Birthday: Unknown 
Birthplace: Illumina Undercity 
Element: Fire 
Affiliation: True Order 
Fighting Style: Heart's Radiance]],
  str_files_intial_report_1602411 = "The day Pepita first came aboard the Colossus was definitely memorable... She showed up looking for %s, saying she came to have some fun. After fighting tooth and nail to get her to sign in, she suddenly said it was impolite for her to show up to a party empty-handed, so she offered to treat us to a big meal and left without another word. It was the first time someone had ever said goodbye to me before getting introductions out of the way, so I was baffled to say the least. But around six o'clock that evening, a bunch of servants carrying a feast fit for a king suddenly showed up at the Colossus! We didn't know what to make of it until we saw Pepita swaggering up behind them. \nWe had so much delicious food that night, and everyone had such a good impression of Pepita afterward.\nBut the next day, we saw some pretty disturbing headlines in the newspaper. Apparently, a group of con artists had stolen an entire banquet's worth of food from a Lumo noble's dinner party... B-But I'm sure it had nothing to do with us...\nIt couldn't be, right?\n—Vice",
  str_files_pet_files1_1602411 = [[
You know... There was a time when I admired my so-called father. Silly, right? Just because of his kindness, intelligence, and decent social standing, I thought he was the best dad in the world. At the very least, he was a lot better than those parents who physically discipline their kids. But then things happened that showed just how blind I had been all along. It just goes to show that you'll never know how rotten a person is until they're put to the test. 
Looking back, there were so many obvious signs of his disgusting cowardice. Like this one time, one of his friends brought his child to visit us. Not only did that snot-nosed kid take my brand-new toy, he even got it all dirty!I was furious! But instead of helping me out, my dad pulled me aside and scolded me for arguing with that kid, and even forced me to put on a big, happy smile! All because his friend was a high-ranking officer in the military! Even though I was still mad, I trusted my dad so much that I never doubted anything he said, so I went with it... Ugh! It makes me livid just thinking about how cowardly I used to be!]],
  str_files_pet_files2_1602411 = [[
I was born with a bad heart, but did he care? No! All he thought about was himself! So when he decided to join the Committee, he sacrificed my mom and me as well! And so I became the Committee's latest lab rat, and he went on living without a care in the world. Heh, but don't think I took all of that lying down! Once I saw his true colors, it lit a raging fire in my heart, one that no one could ever hope to snuff out! Not him, not the Committee, no one! No matter what those researchers did to me, I toughed it out and kept biding my time. But then one day, I woke up only to find out they had replaced my original heart with an artificial one. 
That was the day I stopped being a complete Aurorian. Part of me had been replaced with a machine, and that machine was under their control. They even had the nerve to say it was for my own good, and that it would make me stronger. I was so sick of their ugly, lying faces.The only one who acted any differently towards me was Belisaria... Huh? I don't mean that she cared about me or anything. She just didn't lie to me about the Committee's real goal: to use their artificial heart to control me, their "very important test subject." Haha, it seems to me that they knew I wasn't gonna be especially obedient!]],
  str_files_pet_files3_1602411 = [[
Later on, when I escaped from the Illumina Federation... Hmm? Why do you look so surprised? It's only natural I'd want to get out of there, right? Anyway, my very first stop after escaping was Umbraton. After being cooped up for so long, I wanted nothing more than to cut loose and have some fun! So I changed my look, assumed the name "Pepita Felice," and turned Umbraton into my playground! Even though I totally made up my surname, the whole city thought it was real. You should've seen how respectful they were just because of my name! 
But the fun eventually wore out, and that lifestyle turned out to be a huge bore, so I went looking for some fresh entertainment. That's when I decided to don a heavy cloak, lower my voice, and try my hand at some True Order trickery... If you catch my drift?My newest charade ended up being so successful that even I was surprised by my own talent! But the best part was what happened afterward: Lady Victoria herself came to me with a rare invitation! 
"I sense the passion and confusion of a desperate search burning within your heart. Join the True Order, and I promise that those flames will only burn brighter."
Searching for this so-called "Truth" sounded especially fun to me, so I agreed to join her right away. Not only that... If I had stayed in Umbraton any longer, a new religion would've probably sprung up around me!]],
  str_files_pet_files4_1602411 = "After joining the True Order, I followed them into the Dark Zone on an exploration. A lot happened out there—things that helped me realize my true worth. Even in a gloomy and death-filled place like the Dark Zone, I was able to move around without experiencing any negative effects. Hahaha, no wonder those old farts back in Illumina were so desperate to research me! They didn't want to let me go because my powers were way too valuable to them! That's how I know they'll stop at nothing to recapture me. If they don't strap me to the operating table right away, they'll force me to serve as their guide. \nHmph, you think I'm gonna keep running like a coward? Sorry to disappoint you, but I'm going right back over there! They still have my original heart, and I still have a score to settle with those jerks. Once I take back my heart, I'll finally be complete and no one will ever control me again. When that time comes, I'll avenge my mom and take down my pathetic excuse of a father once and for all. Only then... Will I be truly free.",
  str_files_story_title_35043 = "Serenity",
  str_files_story_des_35043 = "Pepita's old \"disciple\" hasn't forgotten her, even after all this time...",
  str_files_story_title_30134 = "Belated Good Morning",
  str_files_story_des_30134 = "After completing the trial stay at the new theme hotel Lorelei recently acquired, PlayerName decides to check up on her in her room since she hasn't shown up for the final check..."
}
return config
